== Workshop announcement

OtaNix ry organizes a Nix workshop on Tuesday the 14th of April from 17:00 onwards. The topic of the
workshop is Flake vs Reality, where we'll discuss all things flakes. The venue is room Y347 in the
Aalto University Undergraduate Center (Otakaari 1). Food and snacks will be served! We recommend
bringing your laptop in order to participate to the workshop.

For any questions, please contact luukas.portfors\@aalto.fi

